+<p>Ingdilligenz GmbH in Würzburg is the precedent. Its own site markets import-data analysis, supplier communication, emissions support, XML preparation and report submission as a CBAM representative. <!-- CHECK: 02-precedent-offer --> An independent trace records HRB 15952, articles dated 17 November 2021, a register notice published 20 November and €25,000 share capital. <!-- CHECK: 02-precedent-trace --> Together, the records establish a real small-firm precedent for the offer's shape. They do not establish commercial persistence, customers, Dutch prices or payment for the language layer.</p>
 <p>The constraint that breaks the fit is the buyer side. If the reader cannot find a Dutch broker willing to lead meetings and retain the importer contract, A2 makes direct acquisition brittle. If the reader wants physical site work, this also fails personally. It is desk work attached to metal, and the least physical candidate in the book.</p>
