 <p>Those records do not identify how many applicants were above 50 tonnes, how many filed before 31 March, or how many eligible importers missed the date. <!-- CHECK: 02-count-boundary --> The requested numerator and denominator are not public. The honest addressable record is “no more than 1,500” plus an application count contaminated by unnecessary filings. That is enough to reject market-size theatre, not enough to forecast customers.</p>
